LANGUAGE English
DEBUG OFF

BOOK BackyardBenAfter RANDOM NO KEEP
    IF exploredDiningRoom EXIT BEFORE

    PROLOG
        TEXT "Benjamin looks around the room, like is he trying to figure out what you are doing."
    END PROLOG

    PAGE Dirt
        BUTTON "<<Is the whole house this dirty?>>"

        TEXT "
            <<Well,>> he starts, <<10 years ago the house was packed quickly and then close up. There has
            been no one here since then, so expect the worst.>>
    
            You are not encouraged.
        "

        IF NOT exploredBackyardNicely THEN TEXT "
            <<Well,>> he snaps, <<the house sat unused these last 10 years. You were hired to clean, not criticize.>>
        
            This man clearly does not like you.
        "

        EPILOG "Benjamin seems surprised you asked about dirt. Odd since you were hired to clean."
    END PAGE
    
    PAGE Footprints
        BUTTON "<<There are footprints in the dust by that door...>>"
        
        TEXT "<<I think the handyman was in the house yesterday. They must be his.>>"
        
        IF NOT exploredBackyardNicely THEN TEXT "
            <<Then you should sweep it up. That>s what you>re here for, not to complain about dirt.>>
        "

        EPILOG "You notice Benjamin glancing nervously at the footprints. You are starting to wonder what's going on."
    END PAGE

    PAGE AnythingElse
        BUTTON "<<Is there anything else we need to know?>>"
    
        TEXT "
            <<Oh, my, yes. Here>s the key you>ll need to open doors throughout the house.>>
    
            Gain the {c:QItemBrassKey} common item.
    
            <<I must be going. Take your time and send someone to fetch me if you need anything.>>
        
            Ben walks out the back door, saying, <<Everyone needs to get started.>>
        
            Move any investigators who are outside to the dining room. Ben shuts the door behind you.
            <i>Was that a click?</i> Place an Explore token as indicated and remove Ben from the board.
        "
    
        IF NOT exploredBackyardNicely THEN TEXT "
            <<What? Oh, here>s the key to the house. Don>t lose it.>>
        
            As he walks out, he drops the key in your direction. Place the {c:QItemBrassKey} common item
            in Ben>s space. Once outside, Benjamin snaps, <<Everyone inside. No dawddling.>> Move all
            investigators to the dining room and remove Ben from the board.
        
            Ben slams the door shut behind him; place an Explore token as indicated.
        "
    
        EPILOG "[this should never be seen]"
    
        REMOVE TokenBackyardBenAfter
        ADD TokenExploreBackDoorLocked, TokenInvestigatorsDiningRoom
        $MythosKey = TRUE
        talkedToBenAnythingElse = TRUE 
        talkedToBenCount = talkedToBenCount + 1

        @removeDiningRoomInvestigators = TRUE
        TRIGGER @TalkedToBackyardBen AFTER

        EXIT
    END PAGE
END BOOK
